_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟠 Major_ | _⚡ Quick win_

**Filter or merge collapsed `Unknown` proposal statuses before exporting them.**

`MdkProposalType::from` collapses `Add`, `Remove`, `Custom(_)`, etc. into `Unknown`, but this conversion still forwards every core `(ProposalType, ProposalUpgradability)` row 1:1. If more than one unsupported core proposal shows up here, UniFFI will expose multiple indistinguishable `Unknown` entries with potentially different blocker sets, while `upgrade_group_capabilities` rejects `Unknown` outright.

<details>
<summary>🧭 Proposed fix</summary>

```diff
 impl From<mdk_core::groups::CapabilityUpgradeStatus> for MdkCapabilityUpgradeStatus {
     fn from(status: mdk_core::groups::CapabilityUpgradeStatus) -> Self {
         Self {
             per_proposal: status
                 .per_proposal
                 .into_iter()
-                .map(MdkProposalUpgradeStatus::from)
+                .filter_map(|(proposal, upgradability)| {
+                    let proposal = MdkProposalType::from(proposal);
+                    match proposal {
+                        MdkProposalType::Unknown => None,
+                        proposal => Some(MdkProposalUpgradeStatus {
+                            proposal,
+                            upgradability: MdkProposalUpgradability::from(upgradability),
+                        }),
+                    }
+                })
                 .collect(),
         }
     }
 }
```
</details>

